The Safe Voice application is a reporting app designed to allow users to quickly and easily send reports in case of emergencies or concerns. The backend of the application is developed using Java, which handles the main logic, data processing, and functionality of the system. The frontend is created using XML, which is responsible for the user interface design and layout of the app. This combination provides a simple and user-friendly experience for users, allowing them to submit reports efficiently and effectively. The main goal of the Safe Voice app is to improve communication and ensure faster reporting for safety-related situations.
